  "details": "Currently, the chatbox has a couple issues. There's a couple visual glitches, for starters. Sometimes, the 3 dots won't appear when someone's typing or someone's last message gets stuck above their head even after they haven't said anything after for quite a bit. And, the other issue is the default setting being to friends only. Mutes are alienated by this decision and can't talk to most people in public worlds cuz' people don't realize u can set the chatbox visibility to everyone or, even worse, they think it's a friends exclusive feature. Please change the visibility default to everyone. I'm begging here.",
